{"id": "EUVD-2026-74829", "enisaUuid": "991f243c-fc48-3966-918d-180bf111d05c", "description": "Improper input validation in TopicRegion in Apache ActiveMQ, Apache ActiveMQ Broker, and Apache ActiveMQ All\u00a0on all platforms.\n\n\n\n\nAn authenticated client can spoof clientId when removing a durable topic subscription.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache ActiveMQ Broker: before 5.19.11, from 6.0.0 before 6.3.2; Apache ActiveMQ All: before 5.19.11, from 6.0.0 before 6.3.2; Apache ActiveMQ: before 5.19.11, from 6.0.0 before 6.3.2.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 6.3.2 or 5.19.11 which fixes the issue.", "datePublished": "2026-09-09T11:10:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-10T18:00:51", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://lists.apache.org/thread/n9md06jo7ccqmj2mntx4kpcl2d5xqntz"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hx9m-72qj-2q46", "CVE-2026-74761"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.62, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1f154f1a-96a4-30c3-bdb6-4a37bcba3f36", "product": {"name": "Apache ActiveMQ", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "6.0.0 <6.3.2"}, {"id": "58140b8f-c8b4-324e-b557-c9dbdfe4c3f7", "product": {"name": "Apache ActiveMQ All", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.19.11"}, {"id": "58862589-5cdd-3d7a-81dc-b243a71b28ed", "product": {"name": "Apache ActiveMQ", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.19.11"}, {"id": "6d66fb80-600c-3a85-a424-bf7c88052ece", "product": {"name": "Apache ActiveMQ All", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "6.0.0 <6.3.2"}, {"id": "b5760226-2f5e-3933-b8ce-ba1b910ca8c7", "product": {"name": "Apache ActiveMQ Broker", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.19.11"}, {"id": "e4650c05-e15e-3222-ad66-494672e6c092", "product": {"name": "Apache ActiveMQ Broker", "vendor": {"name": "Apa